{"ref":"BDB, תַּהְפֻּכָה","hw":"תַּהְפֻּכָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">תַּהְפֻּכָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. perversity, perverse thing</strong> (only Pr except <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.20\">Dt 32:20</a>)—Pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּהְפֻּכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.20\">Dt 32:20</a> + 8 times; cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.14\">Pr 2:14</a>;—<em>perverse things</em>, particularly utterances <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.12\">Pr 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.32\">10:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.33\">23:33</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, פִּי\" href=\"/BDB,_פִּי\", dir=\"rtl\">פִּי ת׳</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.13\">8:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשׁוֹן ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.31\">10:31</a>, and even <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.28\">Pr 16:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נִרְגָּן</span> <em>slanderer</em>); but also thoughts, devices <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.14\">Pr 6:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.30\">16:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹר ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.20\">Dt 32:20</a> = <em>perverse generation</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לֹא־אֵמֻן בָּם</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ רָ֑ע</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.14\">Pr 2:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשׂוֹת רָ֑ע</span>).","next":"BDB, הֻצַּב","prev":"BDB, מַהְפֶּ֫כֶת"}